            "review_title": "Review at El Gaucho | Lotte Mall West Lake",
            "review_text": "Helph M Honorat\nTokyo, Japan1575 contributions\n0\nDelicious!\nJun 2025 • Friends\nEl Gaucho Steakhouse is a great restaurant to enjoy authentic Argentinian flavors. The steak is tender, juicy, and soft. The atmosphere is warm and welcoming, and the staff went out of their way to make our dining experience enjoyable. I won’t forget how great the wine was. It was really excellent. If you’re a steak lover, I highly recommend this place!\nWritten June 27, 2025",
