            "review_title": "Review at El Gaucho | Lotte Mall West Lake",
            "review_text": "Curt E\n4 contributions\n0\nAuthentic Argentine Flavors\nNov 2023 • Business\nEl Gaucho serves up hearty, savory Argentine cuisine in a slick contemporary setting. The empanadas were stuffed with tasty beef, onions, olives and eggs. The provoleta cheese was ooey-gooey goodness. The grilled steak was juicy and full of smoky, charred flavor. The Malbec wine list does the food justice. Service slipped a bit as the restaurant got busy. Overall, a great introduction to the irresistible flavors of Argentina.\nRead more\nWritten December 18, 2023",
